WEBVTT

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.896
The important thing is
to create a plan in the learning.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.416
"I will practice speaking
every Tuesday and Thursday

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.496
with a friend for 20 minutes.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:09.936
I will listen to a YouTube video
while having breakfast."

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.096
If you create a system in your learning,

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.016
you don't need to find that extra time,

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:16.480
because it will become
a part of your everyday life.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:21.096
And finally, if you want to learn
a language fluently,

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.840
you need also a bit of patience.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:27.336
It's not possible to learn
a language within two months,

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:31.256
but it's definitely possible to make
a visible improvement in two months,